config BR2_PACKAGE_QUUX_ETHERNET_DEVICE
	bool "quux-ethernet-device"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_CADR_COMMON
	help
	  QUUX's Ethernet device, the Linux side: the program that
	  sends the Ethernet frames QUUX's transmit ring names to the
	  tap quux0 and delivers the tap's into QUUX's receive ring,
	  filling in and checking the IPv4, TCP, UDP and ICMP
	  checksums, through the Ethernet device's page in the fabric.

	  QUUX revision 16 only: its init script makes the tap and
	  starts it when the card's fpgarc says --machine quux.  The
	  kernel needs CONFIG_TUN and BusyBox its tunctl.
